  "vibesdr:note": "One style for the app (MapLibre Native) and the web (MapLibre GL JS). Palette copied from vibemap.js; zooms are MapLibre zooms (Leaflet zoom minus one) — see scripts/gen-map-tiles.mjs. Sources and glyphs are placeholders the host fills in.",
  "vibesdr:todo": "glyphs/sprites are filled in by each host: bundled JetBrains Mono (gen-map-glyphs.mjs) and the icons in assets/mapicons.",
  "vibesdr:relief": "Today's baked relief (buildRelief), cut into a z0-4 WebP pyramid by gen-map-tiles.mjs; opacity 0.92 and stacking (above land, below cover) copied from vibemap.js drawRelief.",
  "vibesdr:zoom": "Every zoom here is MapLibre = Leaflet - 1. Rules copied from vibemap.js (LADDER, drawPlaces, drawPoi, drawCountryNames, drawRegionLabels).",
